.101961 .101961 .101961 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 170 Tm /F1 10 Tf 15 TL 1.076667 Tw (This document \(the Agreement\) contains important information about my professional services and business) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.506154 Tw (policies. It also contains summary information about the Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act) Tj T* 0 Tw .072353 Tw (\(HIPAA\), a federal law that provides privacy protections and patient rights with regard to the use and disclosure) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.414667 Tw (of your Protected Health Information \(PHI\) used for the purpose of treatment, payment, and health care) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.969412 Tw (operations. HIPAA requires that I provide you with a Notice of Privacy Practices \(the Notice\) for use and) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.639375 Tw (disclosure of PHI for treatment, payment and health care operations. The Notice, which is attached to this) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.082 Tw (Agreement, explains HIPAA and its application to your personal health information in greater detail. The law) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.34 Tw (requires that I obtain your signature acknowledging that I have provided you with this information. Although) Tj T* 0 Tw .301765 Tw (these documents are long and sometimes complex, it is very important that you read them carefully before our) Tj T* 0 Tw .746111 Tw (next session. We can discuss any questions you have about the procedures at that time. When you sign this) Tj T* 0 Tw .955294 Tw (document, it will also represent an agreement between us. You may revoke this Agreement in writing at any) Tj T* 0 Tw (time.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 60 461 cm
q
.101961 .101961 .101961 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 2 Tm /F2 10 Tf 12 TL (PSYCHOLOGICAL SERVICES) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 60 275 cm
q
.101961 .101961 .101961 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 170 Tm /F1 10 Tf 15 TL 1.902941 Tw (I am a licensed psychologist in the states of Florida \(PY12365\) and New York \(027009\). My approach to) Tj T* 0 Tw .864615 Tw (treatment is psychoanalytically informed, which is a type of psychotherapy that fosters personal development) Tj T* 0 Tw .636 Tw (and liberation from unsatisfying or painful patterns of living. Patient and therapist work together to understand) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.414 Tw (the meaning of the patient\222s emotional reactions, thoughts, memories, fantasies, and dreams in an effort to) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.475714 Tw (alleviate suffering and to expand the capacity for various personal and professional pursuits. Since therapy) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.103846 Tw (often involves discussing unpleasant aspects of your life, you may experience uncomfortable feelings like) Tj T* 0 Tw .646923 Tw (sadness, guilt, anger, frustration, loneliness, and helplessness. On the other hand, psychotherapy often leads) Tj T* 0 Tw .305333 Tw (to better relationships, solutions to specific problems, and significant reductions in feelings of distress. Our first) Tj T* 0 Tw .76 Tw (few sessions will involve an evaluation of you and your needs. Therapy involves a large commitment of time,) Tj T* 0 Tw .528333 Tw (money, and energy, so you should be very careful about the therapist you select. If you have questions about) Tj T* 0 Tw .474211 Tw (my procedures, we should discuss them whenever they arise. If doubts persist, I will be happy to help you set) Tj T* 0 Tw (up a meeting with another mental health professional for a second opinion.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 60 253 cm
q
.101961 .101961 .101961 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 2 Tm /F2 10 Tf 12 TL (SESSIONS) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 60 142 cm
q
.101961 .101961 .101961 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 95 Tm /F1 10 Tf 15 TL .375238 Tw (During our initial sessions, we can both decide if I am the best person to provide the services that you need in) Tj T* 0 Tw .171 Tw (order to meet your goals. My therapy sessions are 50 minutes long and are scheduled at a frequency of one to) Tj T* 0 Tw .098333 Tw (three times per week. Extended sessions may be possible at request at an additional fee \(to be discussed prior) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.933077 Tw (to scheduling individually\). Session length and frequency will be determined collaboratively based on your) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.693889 Tw (particular needs. We will meet on the same days, at the same times, each week. Once our times are) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.522941 Tw (scheduled, you will be expected to pay for all sessions unless you provide 48 hours advance notice of) Tj T* 0 Tw (cancellation. I may make exceptions, at my discretion, for emergency or unusual circumstances.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 60 120 cm
q
.101961 .101961 .101961 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 2 Tm /F2 10 Tf 12 TL (PROFESSIONAL FEES) Tj T* ET
